&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience working at an executive level or equivalent track record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup founder experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategic thinking&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business experience and acumen. You love business as a science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analysis and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional, concise written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
