&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead strategic initiatives&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the CEO&#39;s highest-priority initiatives, end to end, from planning through execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pressure-test strategy with customer, competitive, and market research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extend the CEO&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a proxy for the CEO in internal and external meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate tightly with other executive direct reports with a one team mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead functions or initiatives during transitions or while key roles are being hired&lt;/li&gt;
